    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Hoshaku nachipompelu chawanyana kaIsarela chejima, wuyili neyi, Mwakekalaŋa ajila muloŋa ami Yehova Nzambi yenu najila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakaakamaŋa amama jenu nawatata jenu wejima wenu, mwaka hembaŋa nisabata jami; yami Yehova Nzambi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubalumuka nakutala kudi akishi akutuŋa amukunkulwayi chinjila, kudilila akishi akusunununa chinjila; yami Yehova Nzambiyenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mwakamuketwila Yehova chimuna chanyilambu yakuwunda, mwakahimulambu la kulonda akayiitŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamudya hefuku odu dimwa kahimulambu la nidakalondelamu; neyi yakashalahu yishika nikwifuku damuchisatu akayochi mukesi bwi-i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi akadyahu hela kanti mwifuku damuchisatu, hikushimana; hiyakayiitijaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owu wakayidya wakakoola kuluwa kwindi, muloŋa najiloli chuma chaYehova chajila; muntu owu hadiakwawu akamufumishuhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwaka aŋulaŋa yakudya yamwituŋa denu, bayi wakaaŋula chikupukunyisoŋa yeha deyuku, hela kunonojola yikushalashala mwiha deyi nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakakumuna kumuna yikushalashala mwitempa deyi danyivinyuku, hela kunonojola nyikabu yikuholoka holoka mwitempa deyi danyivinyuku; kayilekeli kazweŋi namweni; yami Yehova Nzambi yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwiya chinjila, kudimbana chinjila, kuleja mukwenu mwakutwamba chinjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusanyika ijina dami chakutwamba chinjila, wakenza kajilola ijina daNzambi yeyi; yami Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumudya mukwenu mbalakanyi chinjila, hela kumubuwa chinjila; wufwetu waŋamba wakufumba, kushakama nawu wufuku wejima wushikanikubudidi, chinjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kushiŋa wajika matu chinjila, kumushila mputamesuchuma chakumudi mbwisha mwakuyayi chinjila, chipa wakamutiyaŋa Nzambi yeyi woma; yami Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuheŋeshapa wuŋaji chinjila; kumwakama kazweŋi nanochu chadiyikazweŋi, hela muneni kumulemesha nanochu chadiyi muneni, chinjila; chiŋa wakasompeshaŋa mukwenu mwaloŋa hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukimbokaŋa kudi akwenu nakuscnda nsachi chinjila; kwimena mashi amukwenu chinjila; yami Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumula mina mana kweyi nkunyi mumuchima chinjila; mukwenu chiŋa kumutotamu hohu, bayi wakakoola nshidi yinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi tenda chinjila; kushiia anyana kawantaŋa jeyi nkunyi kuinuchima chinjila, chiŋa wakakeŋaŋa mukwenu neyi chiwadikeŋaŋa eyi aweni; yami Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakahembaŋa yidika yami. Bayi wakalekela aŋombi jeyi kuyi kanda makudi jacheŋuku; kudima mwiha deyi nyitundu yambutu yiye dichinjila, kuvwala chuma chamahina akubombashana nyitundu yiyedichinjila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi muntu wukushimba nduŋu wamumbanda anotuwu kudi iyala, yena mumbanda wuchidi kanda amukúuli, kanda amuumbuku, akayi babesha chakuyi babesha, kuyŋha nehi, muloŋa mumbanda himwana kachisemuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyala akaleti kudi Yehova, kuchisu chetenti dakubulakena, himulambu windi wakutanya, chizamba chamukoku chamulambu wakutanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chizamba chamukoku chamulambu wakutanya, kapristu akamwilili yakumubuta nachu kumesu aYehova nanshidi yindi yanavulumuniyi, akamwana kenanshidi yindi yanavulumuniyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwakela munashiki dehi mwituŋa, munatumbi dehi nyitondu yeŋiyakudya, nyikabu yayu mwakayifuukula neyi hiyidima; enu kwenu yakekalaŋaneyi hiyidima nyaka yisatu, kuyidya nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wamuchi wananyikabu yayu yejima yakekali yajila yakumuhameka nachu Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wamu chitanu mwakadya tuhu nyikabu yayu, kulonda yakayisoŋelaŋa chachiwahi; yami Yehova Nzambi yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.25",
